WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.137
Module 7 used a large language model as the generator at the end of the rag pipeline.

00:00:06.137 --> 00:00:13.202
Now we are going to open that box and look at what the model is actually doing.

00:00:13.202 --> 00:00:17.122
We will connect tokens, prediction, prompting, generation, local models, evaluation,

00:00:17.122 --> 00:00:22.597
and tool calling back to the rag workflow you already know.

00:00:22.597 --> 00:00:27.912
Think of Module 7 as asking, “What information should the model see?” This module asks,

00:00:27.912 --> 00:00:34.344
“Once the information is in the prompt, what does the model actually do with it?”
